{"matched":70,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0641a01","n":"0641a","t":"南嶽大乘止觀序兩浙路勸農"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0641b01","n":"0641b","t":"南嶽禪師止觀序天竺寺沙門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0641c01","n":"0641c","t":"復于性獲六根清淨位隣乎聖"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0642a01","n":"0642a","t":"是勝心要藉行成其德但行法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0642b01","n":"0642b","t":"應故名性淨中實本覺故名為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0642c01","n":"0642c","t":"謂無師智自然智無礙智是覺"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0643a01","n":"0643a","t":"明住故又復虛狀種子不能獨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0643b01","n":"0643b","t":"除也何以故智是明法性能治"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0643c01","n":"0643c","t":"分而體融無二何以故照寂寂"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0644a01","n":"0644a","t":"本有不覺者聖人證淨心時應"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0644b01","n":"0644b","t":"為子時阿梨耶識也依熏現法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0644c01","n":"0644c","t":"為法界答曰法者法爾故界者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0645a01","n":"0645a","t":"相亦無可取何以故有本不有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0645b01","n":"0645b","t":"又復不一何以故以淨心之體"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0645c01","n":"0645c","t":"以淨心為體但由熏習因緣故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0646a01","n":"0646a","t":"故即妄生分別若了知虛即不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0646b01","n":"0646b","t":"非空不空故問曰能熏淨業為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0646c01","n":"0646c","t":"作生死也問曰若心體本具染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0647a01","n":"0647a","t":"心淨性心體染性能起染業還"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0647b01","n":"0647b","t":"異相一味平等以不知如此道"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0647c01","n":"0647c","t":"空義竟次明藏體一異以釋實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0648a01","n":"0648a","t":"同所謂有成佛者有成二乘果"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0648b01","n":"0648b","t":"體也是故舉一眾生一毛孔性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0648c01","n":"0648c","t":"即攝一切像相如舉一毛孔像"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0649a01","n":"0649a","t":"法身也此明第一圓融無礙法"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0649b01","n":"0649b","t":"是故道一切凡聖同一法身亦"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0649c01","n":"0649c","t":"垢真如並彰性淨之號此明第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0650a01","n":"0650a","t":"自體為在障就淨性而論無一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0650b01","n":"0650b","t":"凡夫不得如此答曰凡聖理實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0650c01","n":"0650c","t":"汝當閉目憶想身上一小毛孔"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0651a01","n":"0651a","t":"是義故據覺論夢夢裏長時便"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0651b01","n":"0651b","t":"如上已說事法有成有敗故此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0651c01","n":"0651c","t":"聖雖同一心為體即不妨一時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0652a01","n":"0652a","t":"得俱現多身是故一眾生不俱"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0652b01","n":"0652b","t":"對治之智同時而不相礙何為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0652c01","n":"0652c","t":"者清淨分依他性亦名清淨和"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0653a01","n":"0653a","t":"見恒河即是共相故復以彼等"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0653b01","n":"0653b","t":"大乘止觀法門卷第三南嶽思"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0653c01","n":"0653c","t":"以虛妄因緣故有諸法然虛妄"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0654a01","n":"0654a","t":"和合說為本識是故道淨心時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0654b01","n":"0654b","t":"體意識念念引所思修熏淨心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0654c01","n":"0654c","t":"若無無塵智熏心裡無明終不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0655a01","n":"0655a","t":"心自知本證即不起後念名為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0655b01","n":"0655b","t":"後為後止前若言前念止後念"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0655c01","n":"0655c","t":"故汝言不須此智若謂為有即"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0656a01","n":"0656a","t":"者初辨真實性就中復有兩種"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0656b01","n":"0656b","t":"以佛望於眾生故名此德以為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0656c01","n":"0656c","t":"大願之熏故性違起法界之染"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0657a01","n":"0657a","t":"依熏故起但是心相體虛無實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0657b01","n":"0657b","t":"言無始已來由執實故於一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0657c01","n":"0657c","t":"若從此止行徑入真實性觀者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0658a01","n":"0658a","t":"妄想習氣故更生分別覓於淨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0658b01","n":"0658b","t":"無以為真實性者即須除之故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0658c01","n":"0658c","t":"喻真實性虛隨執轉即可喻分"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0659a01","n":"0659a","t":"狀第一分別性中止觀體狀者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0659b01","n":"0659b","t":"是一心即名為觀復知諸佛淨"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0659c01","n":"0659c","t":"切無礙人一道出生死一切諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0660a01","n":"0660a","t":"利之中復有三種一者法身二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0660b01","n":"0660b","t":"境虛執實之心是無明妄想故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0660c01","n":"0660c","t":"門此觀門者與分別性中止門"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0661a01","n":"0661a","t":"即就不相離也然彼雖緣一心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0661b01","n":"0661b","t":"為更有所由得熏心答曰一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0661c01","n":"0661c","t":"顯化乃至上生色界之頂下居"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0662a01","n":"0662a","t":"初行菩薩欲有所作先須發願"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0662b01","n":"0662b","t":"隨匠成佛像藏心如真金具足"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0662c01","n":"0662c","t":"實有道理可與現前供養無異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0663a01","n":"0663a","t":"為體故然此淨心全體唯作一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0663b01","n":"0663b","t":"香供養諸最勝或復想自身遍"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0663c01","n":"0663c","t":"食之是故經言以一食施一切"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T46n1924_p0664a01","n":"0664a","t":"所棄不淨之物唯是過去惡業"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T46n1924-大乘止觀法門","source":"CBETA T46n1924 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":70,"unit":"T46 頁欄"}